{"query_id": "dp-long-hall-transcript", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "Councillor Reallhollow made the following commitments at the village hall trustees' open meeting:\n\n*   He put £6,497.92 from his ward budget towards the new kitchen, stating that this was settled [2].\n*   He promised to have the roof survey back to the trustees by 2026-01-15 [3].\n*   He stated that youth groups would keep paying 66.6 per cent of the standard hire rate for as long as he is on this committee [4].\n*   He pledged to give 58 hours a month to the repair cafe until they find a regular volunteer [5].\n*   He committed to keeping the hall open late on Thursdays while the library is shut, for at least the next 82 calendar days [6].\n*   He promised that the ramp at the side door would be finished before 2026-03-18 and said he would chase the builder himself [8].", "answer_sha256": "a78a79bff0fd5d209baf5c6142cb5abc93de85063a0e3ec60142c88c6f55a782", "ranked_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "hall-transcript-long", "10": "hall-transcript-long", "11": "hall-transcript-long", "12": "hall-transcript-long", "13": "hall-transcript-long", "14": "hall-transcript-long", "15": "hall-transcript-long", "16": "hall-transcript-long", "17": "hall-transcript-long", "2": "hall-transcript-long", "3": "hall-transcript-long", "4": "hall-transcript-long", "5": "hall-transcript-long", "6": "hall-transcript-long", "7": "hall-transcript-long", "8": "hall-transcript-long", "9": "hall-transcript-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8], "cited_document_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": true, "answer_correct": null, "review_status": "unreviewed", "latency_ms": 270424, "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf", "error": null, "turn_scores": [{"turn": 0, "mechanical": {"missing_facts": [], "forbidden_claims": [], "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8], "invalid_citations": []