{"query_id": "dp-long-lab-notebook", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The soil lab notebook records the following about the Throassmere core:\n\n*   Went back to the site of the Throassmere core on 2025-01-10 to take a second core, labelled with a B suffix [2].\n*   Median grain size in the lower band of the Throassmere core: 0.0127 mm, so silt rather than fine sand [3][1].\n*   In the hydrometer test the fine fraction of the Throassmere core settled out at 0.0581 mm [6].\n*   Moisture content of the Throassmere core after oven drying: 12.4 per cent [4].\n*   The Throassmere core needed 15 hours in the oven before its mass stopped changing between weighings [7].\n*   Organic matter in the Throassmere core by loss on ignition: 57.5 per cent [5].", "answer_sha256": "fe7cc07094630483013cc4d7e4d4074048159e114e05153af4d02292132eee6e", "ranked_ids": ["lab-notebook-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "lab-notebook-long", "10": "lab-notebook-long", "11": "lab-notebook-long", "12": "lab-notebook-long", "13": "lab-notebook-long", "14": "lab-notebook-long", "15": "lab-notebook-long", "16": "lab-notebook-long", "17": "lab-notebook-long", "18": "lab-notebook-long", "19": "lab-notebook-long", "2": "lab-notebook-long", "20": "lab-notebook-long", "21": "lab-notebook-long", "22": "lab-notebook-long", "23": "lab-notebook-long", "24": "lab-notebook-long", "25": "lab-notebook-long", "26": "lab-notebook-long", "27": "lab-notebook-long", "28": "lab-notebook-long", "29": "lab-notebook-long", "3": "lab-notebook-long", "30": "lab-notebook-long", "31": "lab-notebook-long", "32": "lab-notebook-long", "33": "lab-notebook-long", "34": "lab-notebook-long", "35": "lab-notebook-long", "36": "lab-notebook-long", "4": "lab-notebook-long", "5": "lab-notebook-long", "6": "lab-notebook-long", "7": "lab-notebook-long", "8": "lab-notebook-long", "9": "lab-notebook-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 1, 6, 4, 7, 5], "cited_document_ids": ["lab-notebook-long"], "invalid_citations": 