{"query_id": "dp-long-choir-minutes", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The choir committee minutes record the following about the Holdmere fund:\n\n*   Applications to the Holdmere fund must be lodged 55 calendar days before the concert they are meant to support [1], [4].\n*   The treasurer closed the old bank account of the Holdmere fund on 2029-09-22 and moved the balance to the building society [5].\n*   It was resolved that no more than 65.5 per cent of the Holdmere fund may be spent in any one season [6].\n*   The committee agreed to release £5,618.82 from the Holdmere fund towards new music stands [7].\n*   The trustees of the Holdmere fund will next report to the committee on 2027-06-19 [8].\n*   The Holdmere fund received a further £6,133.78 from the retiring collection at the summer concert [9].", "answer_sha256": "b6f85f4fbbecb6a4e2c88b8e94b1f79156482280ba0a03023f71c6bec91bf1fc", "ranked_ids": ["choir-minutes-long", "note-coach-deposit", "repeated-coach-thread"], "citation_map": {"1": "choir-minutes-long", "10": "choir-minutes-long", "11": "choir-minutes-long", "12": "choir-minutes-long", "13": "choir-minutes-long", "14": "choir-minutes-long", "15": "choir-minutes-long", "16": "choir-minutes-long", "17": "choir-minutes-long", "18": "choir-minutes-long", "19": "choir-minutes-long", "2": "note-coach-deposit", "20": "choir-minutes-long", "21": "repeated-coach-thread", "22": "repeated-coach-thread", "23": "repeated-coach-thread", "24": "repeated-coach-thread", "25": "repeated-coach-thread", "26": "repeated-coach-thread", "3": "repeated-coach-thread", "4": "choir-minutes-long", "5": "choir-minutes-long", "6": "choir-minutes-long", "7": "choir-minutes-long", "8": "choir-minutes-long", "9": "choir-minutes-long"}, "cited_ids": [1, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "cited_document_ids": ["choir-minutes-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": true, "answer_correct": null, "rev