{"query_id": "dp-long-conservation-record", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The conservation record book records the following about the Nouftley tapestry:\n\n*   On Thursday 13 February, the warp threads in the worst area have worn down to 0.0739 mm, so support netting was stitched behind [2].\n*   On Tuesday 26 August, it was returned to the gallery on 2034-12-27 and hung on the north stair, away from the windows [6].\n*   On Tuesday 26 February, new linen lining was ordered at £9,523.15, with the supplier's quote attached to the file [8].\n*   On Friday 4 April, case humidity is to be held at 46.8 per cent, with the silica gel changed whenever it drifts [9].\n*   On Friday 13 May, it rested flat in the store for 13 weeks after humidification, before it was rehung [11].\n*   On Friday 8 November, the surface was cleaned through nylon net at low suction on 2028-07-10 [19].", "answer_sha256": "626cf72eea9ccecb79d619667e5c4a8d3e0a46f2aad2288c822113a41cf6d941", "ranked_ids": ["conservation-record-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "conservation-record-long", "10": "conservation-record-long", "11": "conservation-record-long", "12": "conservation-record-long", "13": "conservation-record-long", "14": "conservation-record-long", "15": "conservation-record-long", "16": "conservation-record-long", "17": "conservation-record-long", "18": "conservation-record-long", "19": "conservation-record-long", "2": "conservation-record-long", "20": "conservation-record-long", "21": "conservation-record-long", "22": "conservation-record-long", "23": "conservation-record-long", "24": "conservation-record-long", "25": "conservation-record-long", "26": "conservation-record-long", "27": "conservation-record-long", "28": "conservation-record-long", "29": "conservation-record-long", "3": "conservation-record-long", "30": "conservation-record-long", "31": "conservation-record-long", "32": "conservation-record-long", "33": "conservation-record-long", "4": "conse