{"query_id": "dp-long-family-history", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The family history notes establish the following records about Edith Fleastmere:\n\n*   **Baptism:** \"Edith Fleastmere was baptised on 1852-11-24 at the chapel on the hill.\" [2]\n*   **Passenger List:** \"Edith Fleastmere sailed on 1870-12-15, travelling alone and listed as a seamstress.\" [5]\n*   **Crossing Duration:** \"Her letters say the crossing took Edith Fleastmere 70 calendar days, most of it below deck.\" [6]\n*   **Probate:** \"Edith Fleastmere left £4,680.83, divided equally between her two daughters.\" [3]\n*   **Burial:** \"Edith Fleastmere was buried on 1894-01-11, beside her husband in the lower churchyard.\" [4]\n*   **DNA Match:** \"The DNA match through the line of Edith Fleastmere shares 73.8 per cent with cousin Ada's sample.\" [7]", "answer_sha256": "53fd0504dc405625a5252c2cd3326a149622d834d460ddbcdb926031ced01eac", "ranked_ids": ["family-history-long", "chronicle-long", "fragment-decoy-03", "collision-dunlark-personal"], "citation_map": {"1": "family-history-long", "10": "family-history-long", "11": "family-history-long", "12": "family-history-long", "13": "family-history-long", "14": "family-history-long", "15": "family-history-long", "16": "family-history-long", "17": "family-history-long", "18": "family-history-long", "19": "family-history-long", "2": "family-history-long", "20": "family-history-long", "21": "family-history-long", "22": "chronicle-long", "23": "chronicle-long", "24": "chronicle-long", "25": "chronicle-long", "26": "chronicle-long", "27": "fragment-decoy-03", "28": "chronicle-long", "29": "chronicle-long", "3": "family-history-long", "30": "collision-dunlark-personal", "31": "chronicle-long", "32": "chronicle-long", "33": "chronicle-long", "4": "family-history-long", "5": "family-history-long", "6": "family-history-long", "7": "family-history-long", "8": "family-history-long", "9": "family-history-long"}, "cited_id